        <constraint type="max" value="0" field="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" scope="self" shared="true" id="5846-2411-f988-df2b" includeChildSelections="true"/>
        <constraint type="min" value="0" field="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" scope="self" shared="true" id="f52d-9678-487e-6744" includeChildSelections="true"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="0b60-64ba-dab2-aba2" name="Multi-spectral visor" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack, re-roll a Wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="5313-7669-e6a9-5577" name="Brôkhyr Guild Support" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this unit is within 3&quot; of one or more friendly ^^**Leagues of Votann Vehicle**^^ or ^^**Ironkin Steeljacks**^^ units, it has the Lone Operative ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Unit Composition" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="6f57-e143-7449-1760">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If this unit’s Brôkhyr Iron‑master model is ever destroyed, all of this unit’s remaining E‑COG models are also destroyed. While embarking within a ^^**Transport^^** and while embarked within a ^^**Transport^^**, each E‑COG model takes up the space of 0 models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Forgewrought Expertise" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="ce7a-e6ed-4d44-a5df">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can repair one friendly ^^**Leagues of Votann Vehicle**^^ or **^^Exoframe^^** unit within 3&quot; of it. One model in that unit regains up to D3 lost wounds, or up to 3 lost wounds if this unit contains an Ironkin Assistant model. Each unit can only be repaired once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="b758-0ae9-517e-8e53" name="Eternal Resentment" hidden="false" targetId="351a-a702-9080-7f08" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
