            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit (excluding **^^VEHICLES^^**) hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
