  <sharedInfoGroups>
    <infoGroup name="Grudges" id="b346-4032-3d54-4e62" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Grudge Demands" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="45b9-2ed0-2f81-0a9d">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle, after both sides have deployed, but before the first turn begins, you must roll a number of 6 equal to the number of units in your Crusade army that harbouring a grudge against your opponent&apos;s Crusade army (each Attached unit harbouring a grudge counts as a single unit).

For each roll of 6, you can select one enemy unit that is on the battlefield to gain one Grudge token (you can select the same unit more than once).

For each roll of 1, you must instead select one unit from your Crusade army that is harbouring a grudge against your opponent&apos;s Crusade army and does not have a Grudge token to gain one Grudge token. While that unit has a Grudge token, you cannot select it as the target of a Stratagem, After that unit has shot or fought, remove that unit&apos;s Grudge token.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="A Grudge Settled" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="4d67-1442-2921-fdb5">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">For each unit in your Crusade army that is harbour a grudge against your opponent&apos;s Crusade army, keep a tally of the number of enemy units destroyed by that unit. At the end of the battle, if that unit has a tally of 3 or more, unless that unit was that unit was destroyed during the battle it&apos;s grudge has been settled - the Grudge note for your opponent&apos;s Crusade army&apos;s Faction is remove from its Crusade card.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Precise Prejudice" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="d9a6-ab83-01fc-7d59">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a model (excluding a **^^Cog^^** model) in a unit from your Crusade army makes an attack, if that unit is harbouring a grudge against your opponent&apos;s Crusade army, re-roll a Hit roll of 1 if the target has 1-2 Grudge tokens, or you can re-roll the Hit roll instead if the target has 3 Grudge tokens.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="To The Death" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="7a69-0a67-366e-2883">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">A unit from your Crusade army that is harbouring a grudge against opponent&apos;s Crusade army cannot Fall Back while it is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </infoGroup>
  </sharedInfoGroups>
</catalogue>
